  "_comment": "SINGLE SOURCE OF TRUTH for the Obi Wag phase routing contract (OPT-10). Edit this file, then run tools/render-phase-table.ps1 to regenerate the human table in phases/README.md. Do not hand-edit the table between the <!-- obi:phase-table-start --> / <!-- obi:phase-table-end --> markers. 'display' fields are presentation-only (table rendering); the routing fields (delegated, default_strategy, recipe, inline_fallback_eligible, primary_signal, special_signals, transitions) are the behavioral contract consumed by orchestration/obi-auto.md. The top-level 'lanes' object (OPT-18) declares each lane's TOTAL ordered phase list; the orchestrator classifies a lane after Author and walks that list.",
